50	\N	\N	2017-12-08 10:44:09.862567	1	https://www.odoo.com		stock_groupbypartner	BCIM	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	Stock Group by partner	35	.. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n   :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n\n======================\nStock Group by Partner\n======================\n\nTry to assign the moves to an existing picking\nthat has not been reserved yet and that does not have the same\nprocurement group but the same partner, locations and picking type\n(moves should already have them identical). Otherwise, create a new\npicking to Assign them to.\n\nInstallation\n============\n\nThere is no specific installation procedure for this module.\n\nConfiguration\n=============\n\nYou need to activate the feature on the picking type.\nYou can also limit to a max weight.\n\nUsage\n=====\n\nEnable the feature on the picking.\nCreate 2 sales orders with a pick/ship delivery.\nYou will have 2 delivery orders but only 1 picking.\n\n.. image:: https://odoo-community.org/website/image/ir.attachment/5784_f2813bd/datas\n   :alt: Try me on Runbot\n   :target: https://runbot.odoo-community.org/runbot/119/8.0\n\nFor further information, please visit:\n\n* https://www.odoo.com/forum/help-1\n\nKnown issues / Roadmap\n======================\n\n* Test and/or fix MTO routing\n\nBug Tracker\n===========\n\nBugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/<project>/issues>`_.\nIn case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\nIf you spotted it first, help us smashing it by providing a detailed and\nwelcomed feedback.\n\nCredits\n=======\n\nImages\n------\n\n* Odoo Community Association: `Icon <https://github.com/OCA/maintainer-tools/blob/master/template/module/static/description/icon.svg>`_.\n\nContributors\n------------\n\n* Jacques-Etienne Baudoux <je@bcim.be>\n\nMaintainer\n----------\n\n.. image:: https://odoo-community.org/logo.png