6	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	RedHat server updated spec	1	\N	1	\N	<1512729889.338838100433350.959034008614743-openerp-private@0f864582638c>	<p>Hello Demo,</p>\n            <p>We have a lot of inquiries about our now solution based on RedHat servers. However I do not have the updated specification ready at hand.</p>\n            <p>Could you please send me the last version of the file asap?</p>\n            <p>Thanks,</p>	\N	f	2017-12-07 10:44:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	3	\N	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
7	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	\N	1	6	1	\N	<1512729889.371104001998901.860418765042838-openerp-private@0f864582638c>	<p>Sure, here it is. Have a nice day!</p>\n<p data-o-mail-quote="1"></p><p data-o-mail-quote="1">Hello Demo,</p>\n    <p data-o-mail-quote="1">-- Original mail stripped --</p>	\N	f	2017-12-08 07:44:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	6	\N	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
8	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	\N	1	6	1	\N	<1512729889.408309936523438.165702939626774-openerp-private@0f864582638c>	<p>I just found a more recent draft of the spec. Jon did some cleaning in the specifications. Could you merge the two documents to have an updated one?</p><p>When it's done, put it on the internal document management system.</p><p>Thanks,</p>	\N	f	2017-12-08 07:44:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	6	\N	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
9	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	\N	1	\N	1	\N	<1512729889.442655086517334.119153623386669-openerp-private@0f864582638c>	<p>Hello,</p><p>I have a friend working at Epic Technologies. He told me they plan to upgrade their backup servers within the next 3 months.</p><p>I think that someone should contact them and check if there is an opportunity.</p>	\N	f	2017-12-08 07:44:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	6	\N	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
10	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	\N	1	4	1	\N	<1512729889.473565101623535.278164567985649-openerp-private@0f864582638c>	<p>Thank you!<br>Could you send me the updated pricelists as negotiated at the beginning of this year?</p>\n            <p>Sincerely,</p>	\N	f	2017-12-08 09:14:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	6	\N	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
