20	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	2017-12-08 10:44:45.649238	\N	1	\N	1	19	1	2	<1512729890.018414020538330.579553305093102-openerp-2-mail.channel@0f864582638c>	<p>When I have too much opportunities in the pipe, I start communicating with prospects more by email than phonecalls.</p><p>I send an email to create a sense of emergency, like <i>"can I call you this week about our quote?"</i> and I call only those that answer this email.</p><p>You can use the email template feature of Odoo to automate email composition.</p>	sales	f	2017-12-05 10:44:00	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>	6	mail.channel	comment	Administrator <admin@yourcompany.example.com>
